        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/mermaid-mask_13gQcdt.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>SFB Games, the creator of acclaimed PS1-style retro-horror <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/crow-country\">Crow Country</a>, has a new game coming this year: The Mermaid Mask. It's a follow-up to the equally acclaimed detective game Tangle Tower and, according to SFB, will arrive on PC and consoles this summer. Better yet, there's <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1696770/The_Mermaid_Mask/\">a demo available for The Mermaid Mask on Steam</a> now.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/crow-country-studio-mermaid-mask-release-window\">Read more</a></p>",
